  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7713201",
      "subQuestName": "Approach the lighthouse",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "771320101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "771320101": {
            "id": "771320101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, maybe this is one of those cases where you think about something hard enough and your body actually moves in the direction you're thinking about without you noticing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320106"
            ]
          },
          "771320106": {
            "id": "771320106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right. Maybe that shadow... was also able to remain here to this day because she held on to her desire to see this big guy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320111"
            ]
          },
          "771320111": {
            "id": "771320111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The big guy... He's walking beneath the waves... Paimon has a feeling we'll never see him again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320112"
            ]
          },
          "771320112": {
            "id": "771320112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seeya, Big Guy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320113"
            ]
          },
          "771320113": {
            "id": "771320113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Well, not that Paimon knows if he can hear us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320115"
            ]
          },
          "771320115": {
            "id": "771320115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He'll hear you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320116"
            ]
          },
          "771320116": {
            "id": "771320116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon hopes so!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7713203",
      "subQuestName": "Melt the ice and snow around the lamp room",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7713207",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "771320114"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "771320114": {
            "id": "771320114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...That big guy was chained up back there... In the end, this lighthouse is where he always wanted to be, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320117"
            ]
          },
          "771320117": {
            "id": "771320117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But that young lady, that shadow... She was only human, so she shouldn't have been able to live this long...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320118"
            ]
          },
          "771320118": {
            "id": "771320118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So what was that shadow, really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320108"
            ]
          },
          "771320108": {
            "id": "771320108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The big guy's? You mean... That the girl never managed to wait for him, and he never did meet her...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320109"
            ]
          },
          "771320109": {
            "id": "771320109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And that the shadow was just a figment of his imagination?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "771320110"
            ]
          },
          "771320110": {
            "id": "771320110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well... But even so, at least he did gain the world in the end, if only in his imagination... Right?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}